OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse of volunteers forces
OL,4,Alifeboat museum closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat museum says it has been
OL,7,Fforced to close after its volunteers
OL,8,Fwere targeted by anti-migrant
OL,9,Fprotesters.
OL,11,FPoole Old Lifeboat Museum said it made
OL,12,Fthe decision after several incidents of
OL,13,F"protesters verbally assaulting our
OL,14,Fvolunteers".
OL,16,FProtesters gathered in the Dorset town
OL,17,Fafter about 140 migrants arrived in a
OL,18,Fsingle dinghy that had crossed the
OL,19,FEnglish Channel, prompting a major
OL,20,Fanti-migrant demonstration in
OL,21,FPortsmouth on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
